re opportunities to throw darts, what is the maximum number of points that Mohan could receive in total?','ÓÂ┤ÓÀûÓÂ╗ÓÀèÓÂ½ ÓÀâÓÂéÓÂøÓÀèÔÇìÓÂ║ÓÀÅ 6 ÓÀüÓÀèÔÇìÓÂ╗ÓÀÜÓÂ½ÓÀÆÓÂ║ÓÀÜ ÓÀÇÓÀÉÓÂ»ÓÂ£ÓÂ¡ÓÀè ÓÂàÓÂ»ÓÀäÓÀâÓÂÜÓÀÆ.','Ó««Ó»üÓ«┤Ó»ü Ó«ÄÓ«úÓ»ìÓ«òÓ«│Ó»ì Ó«ñÓ«░Ó««Ó»ì 6 Ó«çÓ«®Ó»ì Ó««Ó»üÓ«òÓ»ìÓ«òÓ«┐Ó«» Ó«òÓ«░Ó»üÓ«ñÓ»ìÓ«ñÓ«¥Ó«òÓ»üÓ««Ó»ì.',1,'active','2026-08-06 17:14:38','2026-08-07 15:23:13'),(2,1,'English','textbook',1,2,'Place Value','භාග','பின்னங்கள்','8 9 2 Place Value By studying this lesson, you will be able to, ● know the place value corresponding to the position of each digit in a whole number, ● know the value represented by each digit in a whole number and ● read and write in words numbers up to the billions period.',NULL,'ÓÀâÓÂ©ÓÀâÓÀèÓÂ¡ÓÂ║ÓÂÜ ÓÂÜÓÀ£ÓÂºÓÀâÓÀè.',NULL,'Ó«ÆÓ«░Ó»ü Ó««Ó»üÓ«┤Ó»üÓ««Ó»êÓ«»Ó«┐Ó«®Ó»ì Ó«¬Ó«òÓ»üÓ«ñÓ«┐Ó«òÓ«│Ó»ì.',NULL,'SHORT NOTES\n\n1. 8 9 2 Place Value By studying this lesson, you will be able to, ● know the place value corresponding to the position of each digit in a whole number, ● know the value represented by each digit in a whole number and ● read and write in words numbers up to the billions period.\n\n2. 8 9 Now, let us describe the place value corresponding to the position of each digit in a number and the value represented by each of the digits.\n\n3. Example 1 Number Digit Name of the position of the digit Value represented by the digit 45 45 30 4 5 0 Tens place\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\' Ones place\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\' Ones place\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\' 40\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\' 5\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\' 0\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\'\n\n4. 12 13 Now, let us name the positions that each of the digits 2, 4, 5, 6 and 7 occupies in the number 67524 by writing these digits in five positions.\n\n5. Let us write this number by separating it into groups of three, starting from the ones place, as given below.\n\n6. 16 17 When writing a number in standa